*Total Trip Cost**\nNow, we add the cost of the plane tickets and the hotel:\n\n$$\n\\text{Total cost} = \\text{Plane tickets} + \\text{Hotel} = 10,000 + 5400 = \\boxed{\\$15,400}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 Final Answer:\n$$\n\\boxed{\\$15,400}\n$$", "decode_seconds": 9.749176961835474, "draft_calls": 0, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 97, "method": "native_ar", "output_hash": "0492dbf0164ede143b58ba3d6b3bb6dd83fc995144ffab1ca70cac800cc471e5", "output_tokens": 350, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 20522316288, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 20843593728, "problem_id": "gsm8k/051ae2b51a5de494", "profile_regions_ms": {"unattributed_runtime": 9783.495495095849}, "rank": 0, "reference_answer": "15400", "repetition": 0, "request_seconds": 9.783495495095849, "reserved_memory_after_bytes": 20843593728, "reserved_memory_before_bytes": 20843593728, "sampling_seed": 1478355047060880021, "sampling_temperature": 0.6, "target_calls": 350, "time_to_first_token_seconds": 0.03294010879471898, "turn_index": 0}
